COMMENT ON COLUMN vendor.io_line.flight_id IS 'Foreign key linking to campaign.flight. Business justification: IO lines often map to specific flights within campaigns for budget allocation and pacing. Required for flight-level budget tracking, delivery monitoring, and financial planning in advertising media bu LOGICAL REF -> media_ops_db.campaign.flight.flight_id (not enforced: cross-system).';
COMMENT ON COLUMN vendor.io_line.initiative_id IS 'Foreign key linking to project.initiative. Business justification: Insertion order lines represent committed media buys executed within specific projects/initiatives. Linking IO lines to initiative enables project media planning tracking, budget monitoring, and deliv LOGICAL REF -> work_mgmt_db.project.initiative.initiative_id (not enforced: cross-system).';
COMMENT ON COLUMN vendor.io_line.line_item_id IS 'Foreign key linking to campaign.line_item. Business justification: IO lines frequently correspond 1:1 with campaign line items for execution tracking. Essential for linking contractual commitments to delivery execution, reconciliation, and billing in advertising oper LOGICAL REF -> media_ops_db.campaign.line_item.line_item_id (not enforced: cross-system).';
COMMENT ON COLUMN vendor.io_line.media_placement_id IS 'The placement identifier from Google Campaign Manager 360 (CM360) ad server corresponding to this IO line item. Enables trafficking, delivery tracking, and third-party ad serving reconciliation. LOGICAL REF -> media_ops_db.media.media_placement.media_placement_id (not enforced: cross-system).';
